# sent_id = 04_AIDS_7
# text_en = As we know, AIDS has no cure, and the one who has the virus in his blood will show no sign of disease in his body, except in his blood, and he will be able to spread the disease through his blood and his sperm for up to eight or nine years before the real disease starts destroying his body, and it kills him.
# text = kàmar̃ yaddà akà sanìː, cùːtar̃ AIDS bâː ta dà maːgàniː, kuma mài ɗàuke dà ƙwaːyoːyin cùːtâr̃ à jinin-sà , bàː zaː'à ga wata àlaːmàː ta cùːtâr̃ à jìkin-sà ba, sai dai à jinin-sà , kuma yanàː iyà bazà cùːtâr̃ ta jinin-sà dà màniyyìn-sà har̃ shèːkaràː takwàs koː tar̃à kàːfin ainihin cùːtâr̃ tà faːrà laːlàːtà jìkin-sà , tà zama ajàlin-sà .
